https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"- *Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115233.*\n\n### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.rc2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.rc (76addfff1) - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 580.119.02) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nEngine Compilation Configuration Editor disables too many classes when detecting from project:\n\n- GridMap is disabled, even though the project needs it.\n- Several core classes are disabled, which causes compilation to fail until you enable them (see the list below).\n\nList of classes I had to manually remove from the file to get the [3D platformer demo](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/platformer) to compile and run correctly:\n\n```diff\n@@ -102,7 +102,6 @@\n                \"FogVolume\",\n                \"FoldableContainer\",\n                \"FoldableGroup\",\n-               \"Font\",\n                \"FramebufferCacheRD\",\n                \"GDExtension\",\n                \"GDExtensionManager\",\n@@ -136,7 +135,6 @@\n                \"GraphEdit\",\n                \"GraphElement\",\n                \"GridContainer\",\n-               \"GridMap\",\n                \"HMACContext\",\n                \"HTTPClient\",\n                \"HTTPRequest\",\n@@ -194,7 +192,6 @@\n                \"MultiplayerAPI\",\n                \"MultiplayerSpawner\",\n                \"MultiplayerSynchronizer\",\n-               \"Mutex\",\n                \"NativeMenu\",\n                \"NavigationAgent2D\",\n                \"NavigationAgent3D\",\n@@ -344,8 +341,6 @@\n                \"SeparationRayShape3D\",\n                \"Separator\",\n                \"ShaderGlobalsOverride\",\n-               \"ShaderInclude\",\n-               \"ShaderIncludeDB\",\n                \"Shape2D\",\n                \"ShapeCast2D\",\n                \"ShapeCast3D\",\n@@ -394,7 +389,6 @@\n                \"TileMapPattern\",\n                \"TileSet\",\n                \"TileSetSource\",\n-               \"Time\",\n                \"Timer\",\n                \"TorusMesh\",\n                \"Translation\",\n@@ -426,7 +420,6 @@\n                \"VoxelGIData\",\n                \"WeakRef\",\n                \"WebRTCPeerConnection\",\n-               \"Window\",\n                \"WorkerThreadPool\",\n                \"World2D\",\n                \"WorldBoundaryShape3D\",\n```\n\nBuild profiles: [3d_platformer_build_profiles.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24783118/3d_platformer_build_profiles.zip)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open **Project > Tools > Engine Compilation Configuration Editor** in the editor.\n- Click **Detect from Project** and confirm the dialog.\n- Click **Save As** at the top and save the build profile.\n- Try to use the file using `scons target=template_release build_profile=path/to/file.gdbuild` when compiling an export template.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/3d/platformer","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":